Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.12,0:02:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第2季第6集]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.16,0:00:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸要我们继续他的遗志 救助他人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad wants us to pick up where he left off, saving people…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.08,0:00:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,猎杀恶魔 家族事业{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}hunting things, the family business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.38,0:00:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人在吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.76,0:00:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不准动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.43,0:00:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 萨姆？迪恩？- 妈妈 你认识他们？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam? Dean? - Mom, you know these guys?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.85,0:00:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想他们是约翰·温彻斯特的孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, these are John Winchester's boys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.06,0:00:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我是埃伦 那是我女儿乔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I'm Ellen. My daughter Jo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.98,0:00:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是再想再打我一拳吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gonna hit me again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.56,0:00:25.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打电话给我们父亲说你可以帮忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You called our dad. Said you'd help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 帮什么忙？- 当然是有关魔鬼的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Help with what? - The demon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.98,0:00:28.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁？你是怎么知道的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you? How do you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.77,0:00:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我只是开客栈的 但捕猎者都会经过这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just run a saloon. Hunters have been known to pass through now and again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.61,0:00:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,很久以前你父亲也是如此 约翰 就像这家里的一份子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Including your dad, a long time ago. John was like family once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.11,0:00:38.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你认为父亲和埃伦以前在一起过吗？- 不可能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You think Dad and Ellen had a thing? - No way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.95,0:00:41.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那为什么他不告诉我们关于她的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why didn't he tell us about her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.41,0:00:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你妈怎么会牵扯进来的？- 我父亲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How'd your mom get into this stuff? - My dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.79,0:00:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也是个猎捕者 但已经过世了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a hunter. He passed away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.79,0:00:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我能帮忙 - 我知道你能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I could help. - I'm sure you could.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.75,0:00:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但你妈妈可能会杀了我 - 你害怕我妈妈？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But I think your mother might kill me. - You're afraid of my mother?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.30,0:00:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.32,0:01:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我检查过保险丝了 没有坏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I checked the fuses, they're fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.95,0:01:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是电线的问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the wiring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.82,0:01:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 你向我保证 在我搬进来时一切都会安顿好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you promised this place would be ready when I moved in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.41,0:01:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 你现在就要来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you come up now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.00,0:01:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.33,0:01:30.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.51,0:01:41.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,真恶心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gross.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.05,0:02:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么鬼东西？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.24,0:02:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛杉矶 加利福尼亚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Los Angeles, California.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.25,0:02:49.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,在洛杉矶发生了什么事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's in L.A.?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.79,0:02:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人用一种魔鬼仪式 绑架了一个年轻女孩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Young girl's been kidnapped by an evil cult.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.25,0:02:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.79,0:02:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这女孩叫什么？- 凯蒂·赫尔姆斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Girl got a name? - Katie Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.42,0:03:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是有趣 你什么时候变得八卦了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's funny. And for you, so bitchy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.43,0:03:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者 去瞧瞧母女吵架{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whereas on the other hand, catfight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.02,0:03:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你的母亲 对你不需要讲道理{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have to be reasonable!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.52,0:03:13.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不能把我拴在这 - 你想试试吗 宝贝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You can't keep me here. - Don't you bet on that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.44,0:03:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想怎样 把我拴在地下室吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you gonna do, chain me up in the basement?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.02,0:03:17.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想的比那更糟糕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've had worse ideas than that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.94,0:03:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不想待在这儿吗？那就不要了 回学校去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't wanna stay, don't. Go back to school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.32,0:03:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不属于那里 在那我是个收集刀子的怪胎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't belong there. I was a freak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.95,0:03:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,在肮脏的后巷被杀 这就是你的归属吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but getting yourself killed on a back road, that's where you belong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.25,0:03:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 来的不是时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, bad time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.96,0:03:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 知道 女士 - 10点之前我们很少喝酒的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, madam. - Yeah, we rarely drink before 10 anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.96,0:03:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我想知道他们对此有什么想法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. I wanna know what they think about this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.26,0:03:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不在乎他们怎么想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care what they think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.38,0:03:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里营业吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you guys open?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.18,0:03:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! - Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.14,0:03:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还是到对面的Arby的快餐店吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll just check out the Arby's down the road.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.50,0:04:12.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈维酒馆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harvelle's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.08,0:04:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 牧师{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Preacher.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.17,0:04:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,三周前一名年轻的女孩 在费城的一间公寓里失踪了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three weeks ago, a young girl disappears from a Philadelphia apartment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.34,0:04:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拿着 这不会咬人 - 是的 它不咬人 但你妈会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Take it, it won't bite. - No, but your mom might.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.93,0:04:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这女孩不是第一个失踪的女孩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This girl wasn't the first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.53,0:04:30.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,在过去的80年里有6名女孩失踪了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over the past 80 years, six women have vanished…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.02,0:04:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,在同一栋楼里 而且都是金发{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}all from the same building, all blonds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.43,0:04:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是每10或20年才发生一次 所以警察对此并没有在意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only happens every decade or two, so cops never eyeball the pattern.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.31,0:04:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以凶手要么是一个老年连环杀手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're either dealing with a serial killer{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.44,0:04:41.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些东西是谁整理的？阿什？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who put this together? Ash?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.36,0:04:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己理的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did it myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.07,0:04:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得承认 我们一路上查的都是小案子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta admit, we hit the road for a lot less.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.04,0:04:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很好 如果你喜欢 这案子就归你们了 - 妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good. You like the case so much, take it. - Mom{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.59,0:04:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔安娜？贝思家失去的已经够多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joanna Beth, this family has lost enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.37,0:04:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想再失去你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't lose you too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.38,0:05:02.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是不想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just won't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.49,0:05:34.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,抢走乔的案子让我有些不安{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel kind of bad, snaking Jo's case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.46,0:05:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吧 也许是她更适合做文书工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe she put together a good file…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.37,0:05:41.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你有没有见过她出去做过？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but could you see her out here working one of these things?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.46,0:05:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想是没干过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.09,0:05:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么发现吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Getting anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.76,0:05:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,没 还没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.52,0:05:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.60,0:05:58.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.11,0:06:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy crap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.45,0:06:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是空灵物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's ectoplasm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.79,0:06:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 我知道 我们要对付的是什么东西了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Sam, I think I know what we're dealing with here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.04,0:06:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可是个大家伙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the Stay Puft Marshmallow Man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.13,0:06:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 这样的东西我只见过两次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, I've only seen this stuff, like, twice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.84,0:06:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是 能留下这样的东西 这恶灵的厉气一定不小{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, to make this stuff, you have to be one majorly pissed - off spirit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.43,0:06:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那在他把更多的女孩藏起来之前 先抓住这个鬼东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's find this badass before he snags any more girls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.35,0:06:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 这房子不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's so convenient.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.64,0:06:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把它修的很好了 所有的房间都有家俱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fixed it up real nice. Apartments come furnished too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.23,0:06:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是太空旷了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is so spacious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.48,0:06:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我朋友一定要让我来看看这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My friend told me that I had to come check it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.15,0:06:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得说他是对的 这里真的很不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I have to admit that she was right.You did a really good job with this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.32,0:06:52.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在这里做什么？- 是你啊 亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the hell are you doing here? - There you are, honey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.03,0:06:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的男朋友迪恩和他的弟弟萨姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my boyfriend Dean and his buddy Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.83,0:06:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴见天你 你找到个好女孩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to meet you. Quite a gal you got here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.37,0:07:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 她很火{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, she's a pistol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.67,0:07:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你们看过公寓了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So did you already check out the apartment?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.05,0:07:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那个要租的公寓 - 是的 我们很喜欢 不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The one for rent. - You bet. Yes. Loved it. Great flow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.05,0:07:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们怎么进来的？- 门是开着的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How'd you get in? - It was open.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.85,0:07:16.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾德 上一个住客是什么时候搬出去的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Ed, um, when did the last tenant move out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.39,0:07:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 大约一个月前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, about a month ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.22,0:07:20.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是不知所踪 害我还要再把它租出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut and run too. Stiffed me for the rent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.69,0:07:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 那是她的损失 我们赚到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, her loss, our gain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.35,0:07:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要迪恩喜欢 我就满足了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because if Dino loves it, it's good enough for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.86,0:07:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, sweetie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.28,0:07:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们租了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll take it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.99,0:07:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.12,0:07:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我帮你拍软沙发了 - 你妈知道你在这里吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll flip you for the sofa. - Does your mother know you're here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.37,0:07:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我跟她说我去维加斯了 - 你认为她会吃你这一套？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Said I was going to Vegas. - She'll buy that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.75,0:07:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不是白痴 我让阿什在信用卡上动手脚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not an idiot. I got Ash to lay a credit card{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.72,0:07:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,让人觉得我是在去赌城的路上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}trail straight to the casinos.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.04,0:07:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不应该对你妈妈说谎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you shouldn't lie to your mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.26,0:07:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不应该出现在这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shouldn't be here either.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.88,0:07:55.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经在这了 所以不要不爽了 认了吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I am, so untwist your boxers and deal with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.55,0:07:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 那些钱你是从哪弄来的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd you get all that money, anyways?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.76,0:07:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在客栈打工得来的 - 捕猎者出手可不会那么大方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Working. - Hunters don't tip that well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.14,0:08:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他们也不那么会打牌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they aren't that good at poker either.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.44,0:08:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁？- 她和你在一起吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. Is she with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.07,0:08:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 嗨 埃伦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hi, Ellen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.40,0:08:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,她留了个纸条说去维加斯了 我根本不相信她的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She left a note she's in Vegas. I don't believe it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.07,0:08:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你敢说？- 我就说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't tell her. - I'm telling her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.95,0:08:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我会杀了你 - 你不会的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're not supposed to be here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.10,0:08:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.95,0:08:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我没见过她 - 你确定？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Haven't seen her. - You sure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.58,0:08:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我确定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.91,0:08:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好 如果她出现 你就把她给拖回来？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, if she shows up, you'll drag her back here, won't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.12,0:08:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是当然 - 好了 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Absolutely. - Okay. Thanks, honey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.80,0:08:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方是1924年建的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place was built in 1924.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.97,0:08:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里本来是仓库{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was originally a warehouse…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.68,0:08:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,几个月前改建成公寓的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}converted into apartments a few months ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.26,0:08:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？那在1924年之前这里有什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, what was here before 1924?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.55,0:08:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么也没有 一块空地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing. Empty field.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.06,0:08:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,最大的可能性是 有人惨死在那座房子里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So most likely scenario, someone died bloody in the building…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.77,0:08:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在他的灵魂又回来作祟了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}now he's back and raising hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.77,0:08:50.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经查过了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Already checked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.27,0:08:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去82年里 没有任何暴力死亡事件{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the past 82 years, zero violent deaths.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.07,0:08:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非清洁工在湿地板上滑倒的事也算{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless you count a janitor who slipped on a wet floor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.99,0:08:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能坐下吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you sit down, please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.16,0:09:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你查过警察局的纪录 和郡里的死亡纪录了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So have you checked police reports, county death records?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.29,0:09:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,讣告 验尸房报告 以及其他信息来源{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obituaries, mortuary reports and seven other sources.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.50,0:09:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道自己该怎么做 - 我想还有漏网之鱼吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know what I'm doing. - Think the jury's still out on that one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.84,0:09:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能不能把刀放下？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you put the knife down?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.84,0:09:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那么 有可能是别的什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so, uh, it's something else, then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.14,0:09:21.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是某个被诅咒的物品 有灵魂附在上面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe some cursed object that brought a spirit with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.01,0:09:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得把整座大楼扫描一遍 是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta scan the building, everywhere we can get to, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.02,0:09:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 你和我负责最上面的两层楼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. So you and me will take the top two floors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.02,0:09:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是分开行动比较快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd move faster if we split up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.23,0:09:32.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 这可由不得你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this isn't negotiable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.11,0:09:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你打算请我吃晚餐吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you gonna buy me dinner?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.03,0:09:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这话是什么意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.82,0:09:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想钓我的话 最好是请我吃饭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're gonna ride me this close, it's only decent you buy me dinner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.66,0:09:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也太荒唐了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's hilarious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.00,0:09:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,骗你妈就已经够糟糕的了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's bad enough I lied mom{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.21,0:09:47.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还以为我会让你离开我的视线吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but if you think I'm letting you out of my sight…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.83,0:09:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道你有没有注意到 那恶灵喜欢你这种类型的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't know if you've noticed, but you're the spirit's type.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.84,0:09:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.84,0:09:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想自己当诱饵？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna be bait?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.34,0:09:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可是引它出来最快捷的办法 你知道的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quickest way to draw it out and you know it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.55,0:09:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 我真后悔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - I'm so regretting this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.72,0:10:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经受够了你的胡说八道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I've had it up to here with your crap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.14,0:10:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说什么 - 你大男子主义的胡说八道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Excuse me? - Your chauvinist crap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.85,0:10:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你认为女人干不了这种事情 - 这跟性别没有关系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You think women can't do the job. - This aingt Gender Studies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.27,0:10:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,女人当然能做这种事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Women can do the job fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.90,0:10:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,菜鸟就不行 你根本没有任何经验{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amateurs can't. You got no experience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.23,0:10:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在满脑子都是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you do have is a bunch of half - baked romantic notions…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.36,0:10:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些酒鬼灌输给你的半吊子浪漫想法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that some barflies put in your head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.36,0:10:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说这话的口气怎么那么象我妈 - 这不好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now you sound like my mother. - That's a bad thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.95,0:10:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 因为我告诉你… - 什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Because let me tell you - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.91,0:10:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.58,0:10:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不行 是你先提起的 - 乔 你还有别的选择{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, you started this. - Jo, you got options.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.75,0:10:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有哪个神志清醒的人会选择这种人生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one in their right mind chooses this life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.84,0:10:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸从我小时候就开始训练我了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I started in this when I was so young…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.79,0:10:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我希望当时能有别的选择 - 你喜欢这个工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …I wish I could do something else. - You love this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.55,0:10:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 可我这人有点不正常{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but I'm a little twisted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.00,0:10:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不觉得我也有点不正常吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't think I'm a little twisted too?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.22,0:10:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔 你有个关心你的妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jo, you got a mother that worries about you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.56,0:10:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,她希望你能得到更好的 那些都是好事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who wants something more for you. Those are good things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.27,0:10:50.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能把这样的事丢弃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't throw things like that away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.40,0:10:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,丢了就很难再找回来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might be hard to find later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.27,0:11:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.31,0:11:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是很肯定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.61,0:11:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你闻到了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You smell that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.53,0:11:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么味道 煤气泄露？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that, a gas leak?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.66,0:11:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 是别的什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, something else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.79,0:11:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道那是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.37,0:11:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是叫不出名字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just can't put my finger on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.46,0:12:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜你刚刚发现了第一个恶灵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mazel tov. You just found your first spirit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.13,0:12:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,它躲在通风管道里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's inside the vent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.56,0:12:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.00,0:12:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面有东西 拿着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something in there. Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.31,0:12:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人留着纪念品呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody's keeping souvenirs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.66,0:13:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天啊这栋楼真是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This building, I swear to God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.10,0:14:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.27,0:15:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安 公主{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morning, princess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.36,0:15:09.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 萨姆在哪里？- 他去买咖啡了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's Sam? - Went to get coffee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.62,0:15:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的腰啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ohh, my back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.95,0:15:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在那张大软床上睡得好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you sleep on that big, soft bed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.00,0:15:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没睡 我刚刚把所有的资料重新看了一遍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't. Just been going over everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.89,0:15:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拿着这个 - 这是要干吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here. - What's this for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.85,0:15:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个玩起来 可比你手里的小刀有意思多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll work a lot better than that little pig sticker you're twirling around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.53,0:16:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,威廉·安东尼·哈维{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}William Anthony Harvelle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.67,0:16:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我的错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. My mistake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.72,0:16:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么你…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.10,0:16:20.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于你父亲 你记得些什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you remember about your dad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.35,0:16:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一件出现在你脑海里的事是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, what's the first thing that pops into your head?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.15,0:16:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 告诉我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, tell me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.16,0:16:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当时才六七岁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was 6 or 7…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.83,0:16:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着 嗯… 他第一次带我去射击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, uh, he took me shooting for the first time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.00,0:16:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,打栅栏上的瓶子之类的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, bottles on a fence, that kind of thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.42,0:16:53.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打中了每个瓶子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bull's eyed every one them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.47,0:16:58.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他笑了 就像…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He gave me this smile, like…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.72,0:17:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.73,0:17:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一定很为你骄傲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must have been proud.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.27,0:17:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸爸呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about your dad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.70,0:17:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲去世得时候 我还是个小女孩 但是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was still in pigtails when my dad died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.32,0:17:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我仍然记得他打猎回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I remember him coming home from a hunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.79,0:17:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他推开门 就象… 像史蒂夫·麦奎一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd burst through that door like Steve McQueen or something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.71,0:17:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后把我搂在怀里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he'd sweep me up in his arms…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.54,0:17:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我甚至能嗅到他那件旧夹克得皮革味{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'd breathe in that old leather jacket of his.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.59,0:17:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我妈妈又气又哭？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my mom, who was sour and pissed…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.47,0:17:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一走又恢复了笑容{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the minute he left, she started smiling again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.76,0:17:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we were{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.98,0:17:47.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还是一家人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were a family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.19,0:17:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想知道我为什么干这样的活吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna know why I wanna do the job?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.78,0:17:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.41,0:18:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我觉得能和他在一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my way of being close to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.16,0:18:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好 告诉我这难道有错吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, tell me, what's wrong with that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.71,0:18:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.88,0:18:17.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 咖啡在哪儿？- 外头有好多警察{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's the coffee? - There are cops outside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.30,0:18:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,又有一个女孩失踪了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another girl disappeared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.77,0:18:30.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,住在2楼的埃利斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Theresa Ellis. Apartment 2-F.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.02,0:18:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的男朋友今天一早向警局报失踪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her boyfriend reported her missing around dawn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.40,0:18:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那她的公寓怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And her apartment?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.94,0:18:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,墙上 天花板上到处都是裂缝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cracks all over the plaster, walls, ceiling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.69,0:18:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有空灵物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was ectoplasm too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.07,0:18:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据那些东西和那簇头发{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Between that and that hair{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.20,0:18:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得那个恶灵是从透过墙进来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd say this sucker's coming from the walls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.74,0:18:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,可那会是什么东西呢？那栋楼的历史很清白呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but who is it? Building's history is totally clean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.96,0:18:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是我们看错地方了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we're looking in the wrong place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.46,0:18:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你什么意思？- 看看这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you mean? - Check this out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.59,0:18:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 空地？- 这栋楼就建在这片空地上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- An empty field? - It's where this building was built.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.38,0:19:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看它隔壁是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a look at the one next door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.89,0:19:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,窗子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The windows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.14,0:19:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 铁条 - 旁边是一所监狱？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bars. - We're next door to a prison?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.44,0:19:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 阿什 对了 如果你胆敢把这事告诉我妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Ash. And if you breathe a word of this to my mom…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.98,0:19:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我会的 用钳子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right, I will. With pliers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.19,0:19:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 Moyamensing监狱 建于1835年 在1963年被推倒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Moyamensing prison, built in 1835, torn down in 1963.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.37,0:19:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这个 以前他们处决犯人的方式{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And get this, they used to execute people…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.62,0:19:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是吊死在监狱旁的那块空地上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}by hanging them in the empty field next door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.41,0:19:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 我们需要在那里被处决所有犯人的名单{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then, we need a list of all the people executed there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.46,0:19:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿什已经在弄了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ash is already on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.97,0:19:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,有157个名字？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A hundred fifty seven names?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.05,0:19:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们得把范围缩小一下 - 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We gotta narrow that down. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.93,0:19:49.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则的话真得累死人的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or else we're gonna be digging up a hell of a lot of stiffs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.23,0:19:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫尔曼 韦伯斯特 马杰特？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Herman Webster Mudgett?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.57,0:20:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.32,0:20:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是H。-H。- 霍姆斯的真名吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wasn't that H.H. Holmes' real name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.70,0:20:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是开玩笑吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta be kidding me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.21,0:20:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍姆斯在1896年5月7日于Moyamensing被处死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yup. Holmes was executed at Moyamensing May 7th, 1896.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.21,0:20:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,H。-H。-霍姆斯本人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}H.H. Holmes himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.55,0:20:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是说 这太不可思议了 - 这家伙是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, I mean, what are the odds? - Who is this guy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.22,0:20:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,连环杀手这个词是霍姆斯发明的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The term "multi murderer, " they coined it to describe Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.51,0:20:30.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是美国第一个连环杀手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was America's first serial killer before{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.85,0:20:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时还没有人知道连环杀手是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}anybody knew what that was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.10,0:20:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他承认了27宗谋杀 但有人认为受害者至少有100多个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He confessed to 27 murders. Some think over a hundred.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.44,0:20:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他偏爱的受害者类型是 漂亮纤弱 金发碧眼的女性{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And his victim flavor of choice: pretty, petite blonds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.23,0:20:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他用氯仿麻醉后再杀了她们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He, uh, used chloroform to kill them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.28,0:20:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是我昨晚在走廊上闻到的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is what I smelled in the hallway last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.74,0:20:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他的窝里 警察找到了人体的残留物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}At his place, cops found human remains…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.95,0:20:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,骨头碎片和血迹斑斑的金色长发{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}bone fragments and long locks of bloody blond hair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.08,0:20:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 他肯定知道怎么选择受害者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy, you sure know how to pick them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.33,0:20:58.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只要找到他的尸骨 撒上盐烧了就行 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just find the bones, salt them and burn them, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.34,0:20:59.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,没那么简单{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's not that easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.84,0:21:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然他的尸体葬在镇上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His body is buried in town…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.38,0:21:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是那里被好几吨的水泥裹着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's encased in a couple tons of concrete.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.30,0:21:05.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？为什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.93,0:21:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,传闻说他不愿任何人去动他的尸体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The story goes that he didn't want anybody mutilating his corpse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.26,0:21:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为 你知道 那是他生前干的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because, you know, that's what he used to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.22,0:21:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.81,0:21:17.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有个更麻烦的问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We might have an even bigger problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.90,0:21:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有什么更麻烦的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How does this get bigger?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.57,0:21:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍姆斯在芝加哥建过一栋公寓楼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holmes built an apartment building in Chicago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.90,0:21:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人管它叫「杀人小楼」 整个大楼就像个死亡机器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They called it the Murder Castle. The whole place was a death factory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.61,0:21:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,到处是机关 陷阱和迷烟管{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They had trapdoors, acid vats, quicklime pits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.49,0:21:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还造了些密室… 就在墙里面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He built these secret chambers inside the walls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.75,0:21:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,把受害者关进去 让他们先活上几天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd lock his victims in, keep them alive for days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.50,0:21:39.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些人被他闷死 另一些则被饿死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some he'd suffocate, others he'd let starve to death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.00,0:21:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说特丽萨可能还活着 就在这些墙里面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Theresa could still be alive. She could be inside these walls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.92,0:21:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要找些大锤和铁锹来砸碎墙壁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need sledgehammers, crowbars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.63,0:21:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是任何可以藏得下一个女孩的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta smash these walls anywhere thick enough to hide a girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.15,0:22:07.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 检查完东南面的墙后再打给我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, call us after you check the southeast wall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.90,0:22:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆快查完一楼了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam's almost done with the first floor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.12,0:22:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还没有找到那个混蛋囚犯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hasn't found jack squat either.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.17,0:22:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？- 太窄了过不去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is it? - It's too narrow. I can't go any further.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.88,0:22:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让我看看 - 什么 你干嘛… ？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let me see. - What. What are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.05,0:22:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我得先理理「管子」 - 什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Should have cleaned the pipes. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.01,0:22:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得先洗洗管子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish the pipes were clean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.93,0:22:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 我可以过去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up. I can fit in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.23,0:22:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要一个人去那里面 - 你有更好的主意吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're not going in there by yourself. - You got a better idea?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.15,0:22:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.96,0:23:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在哪？- 到达北面的墙了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you? - By the north wall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.28,0:23:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在要从一个像是通风管道的地方下去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm heading down some kind of air duct.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.28,0:23:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 不 不 呆在上面 - 我们得救出那个女孩 不是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, no, no, stay up here. - Dean, we gotta find this girl, don't we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.74,0:23:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.28,0:23:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我这就过去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I'm heading to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.06,0:24:01.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.61,0:24:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.70,0:24:15.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.28,0:24:19.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔？乔？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jo? Jo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.67,0:24:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.11,0:24:52.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.28,0:24:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.75,0:25:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他抓走了乔 - 什么？发生什么事了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's got Jo. - What? How'd that happen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.30,0:25:11.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有陪着她 让她落单了 该死的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't with her. I left her alone. Damn it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.21,0:25:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们会找到她的 - 去哪找？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look, we'll find her. - Where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.76,0:25:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在墙里面 - 我们已经在了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Inside the walls. - We've been inside the walls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.22,0:25:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有女孩在那里 她也不在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of the other girls are there. She won't be either.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.09,0:25:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,先静下来想想 也许我们把霍姆斯的杀人地点想错了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's take a beat and think about this. Maybe we got Holmes' m.o. wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.89,0:25:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们得想的快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we better frigging think fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.60,0:25:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好？- 你说谎 她就在你那{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - You lied to me. She's there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.44,0:25:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 埃伦 - 阿什全招了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ellen. - Oh, Ash told me everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.03,0:25:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然他是个天才 但是说起谎来却像个小孩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a genius, but folds like a cheap suit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.98,0:25:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,快让我女儿听电话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put my damn daughter on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.53,0:25:38.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会打回给你的 她 呃 有些女人的事要做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll call you back. She's taking care of feminine business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.78,0:25:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 她在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, right. Where is she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.62,0:25:43.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.79,0:25:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你瞧 我们会把她带回来的 - 带她回来？从哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look, we'll get her back. - Get her back? Back from what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.58,0:25:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我猎杀的恶灵… 把她抓走了 - 哦 我的天哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The spirit we're hunting, it took her. - My God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.13,0:25:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她会没事的 我保证 - 你保证？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She'll be okay.I promise. - You promise?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.63,0:25:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你保证？这不是我第一次 听温彻斯特家的人说这话了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is not the first time I've heard that from a Winchester.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.76,0:25:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 如果她有什么三长两短…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - If anything happens to her{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.55,0:26:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会的 我不会的 埃伦 我真的很抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It won't. I won't let it. Ellen, I'm sorry. I really am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.60,0:26:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在马上坐第一班飞机过去 几个小时后就到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm taking the first flight out. I'll be there in a few hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.73,0:26:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.40,0:26:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要再自责了 迪恩 你也不想的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't beat yourself up. There's nothing you could have done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.40,0:26:15.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拜托告诉我你发现了什么 - 呃 算是吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tell me you got something. - Uh, maybe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.03,0:26:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你瞧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.82,0:26:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看霍姆斯的杀人小楼蓝图{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at the layout.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.74,0:26:21.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里有墙内的拷问密室 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's other torture chambers inside the walls, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.66,0:26:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是有一个我们没有注意到… 在他的地下室还有一个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there's one we haven't considered, the one in his basement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.04,0:26:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但这栋楼没有地下室 - 是的 这里没有 但我刚刚发现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This building doesn't have a basement. - Right, but I just noticed this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.92,0:26:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,在下面的地基里 看起来像个废弃的下水道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beneath the foundation, looks like part of an old sewer system…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.50,0:26:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 已经被荒废了… - 我们走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …that hasn't been used for - Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.03,0:27:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.38,0:27:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,有… 有人在？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is anybody there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.92,0:28:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫特丽萨吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your name's Theresa?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.51,0:28:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.51,0:28:09.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许这么说没有用 但是… 我是来这救你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This won't make you feel better, but I'm here to rescue you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.39,0:28:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天哪 他就在外面 他要来杀我们了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God. He's out there. He's gonna kill us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.10,0:28:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他杀不了我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he won't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.06,0:28:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会逃出去的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're getting out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.19,0:28:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的朋友正在找我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My friends are looking for us. They'll find us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.78,0:28:23.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天哪 他来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God, he's here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.74,0:28:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘 小声点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh! Just be quiet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.55,0:29:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这里了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.17,0:30:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 准备好了？- 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.86,0:31:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真可爱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're so pretty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.82,0:31:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,真漂亮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.57,0:31:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,下地狱吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.61,0:31:46.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢那样吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you like that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.27,0:31:49.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,纯铁的 你个变态混蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pure iron, you creepy ass son of a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.80,0:32:54.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他走了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he gone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.55,0:32:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 我…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.36,0:33:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.37,0:33:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}NO!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.99,0:33:24.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 乔 - 我在这{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jo? - I'm here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.89,0:33:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.86,0:33:51.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来救你出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna get you out of here, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.32,0:33:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.99,0:33:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.74,0:33:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.78,0:34:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还好吗？- 好多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You all right? - Been better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.91,0:34:05.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他回来之前我们快走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get out of here before he comes back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.50,0:34:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 事实上 你还不能马上离开这里 - 什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't think you're leaving here yet. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.21,0:34:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得我说过 由你来当诱饵是个馊主意吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember when I said you being bait was a bad plan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.00,0:34:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在那是唯一一个办法了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now it's kind of the only one we got.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.21,0:35:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,就现在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.89,0:35:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽情的叫吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scream all you want, you dick…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.60,0:35:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是走不出这盐圈的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but there's no way you're stepping over that salt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.78,0:36:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么… 这活有你想像中的那么迷人吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this job as glamorous as you thought it would be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.04,0:36:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了你裤子上的屎尿 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, except for all the pee your pants terror, yeah, sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.17,0:36:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是那个叫特丽萨女孩 因为我们活了下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that Theresa girl's gonna live a life because of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.42,0:36:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这值得的 不是吗？- 是啊 是的 值得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's worth it, isn't it? - Yeah. Yeah, it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.51,0:36:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 如果有人再找到这个下水道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what if somebody finds that sewer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.63,0:36:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者暴雨把那些盐冲走了呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or a storm washes the salt away?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.55,0:36:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,两种可能都有 那也是为什么我们要等会再走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both very fine points, which is why we're waiting here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.60,0:36:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,等什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.61,0:36:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.21,0:36:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你偷了一辆水泥搅拌车？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ripped off a cement truck?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.17,0:37:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会还回去的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give it back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.40,0:37:20.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就能把他死死地困在下面了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that ought to keep him down there till hell freezes over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.73,0:37:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你… 你不会突然骂我吧 会吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy, you really weren't kidding about flying out, were you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.62,0:38:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,来点音乐怎样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about we listen to some music?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.01,0:38:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一路有的受了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is gonna be a long drive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.77,0:38:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃伦…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ellen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.65,0:38:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切都是我的错 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my fault, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.98,0:38:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我撒了谎 抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lied to you and I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.53,0:38:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是乔做的很不错 她爸爸一定会为她骄傲的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Jo did good out there. I think her dad would be proud.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.45,0:38:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要给我这么说… 你不配{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you dare say that. Not you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.41,0:38:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要和我的女儿谈一下 单独{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need a moment with my daughter alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.29,0:39:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很生气 我能理解{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're angry, I understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.75,0:39:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,远远不是生气可以形容的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angry? Angry doesn't begin to touch it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.75,0:39:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们好好想想吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just think about this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.30,0:39:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一切都很好 我还活着 - 在我丢掉你后就不会了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Everything's okay. I'm alive. - Not after I'm through with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.18,0:39:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为我猎鬼 还是因为别的事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this about me hunting or something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.93,0:39:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你竟让那对兄弟把你当诱饵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They used you as bait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.51,0:39:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就在我后面做掩护{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were there backing me up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.26,0:39:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是为什么你不是干这活的料{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is why you don't have the sense to do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.14,0:39:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你轻易地把性命交给他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're trusting them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.44,0:39:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}John?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.74,0:39:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你和约翰是朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you and John were friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.87,0:39:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 曾经是 对不起 我不是指… - 妈妈…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, we were. I'm sorry, I didn't - Mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.21,0:39:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么事你没告诉我？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What aren't you telling me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.81,0:40:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那么糟吗？- 现在不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That bad, huh? - Not right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.98,0:40:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,出什么事了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.35,0:40:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 告诉我吧 - 放开我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, talk to me. - Get off me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.36,0:40:08.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不起 再见了 - 迪恩…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry. See you around. - Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.99,0:40:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来我爸爸在最后一次行动时有个拍档{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turns out my dad had a partner on his last hunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.20,0:40:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好笑的是他一向是单独行动的 那个家伙也是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Funny, he usually worked alone. This guy did too…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.25,0:40:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我猜我父亲以为可以信任他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but guess my father figured he could trust him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.29,0:40:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果他错了 那个家伙搞砸了 让我爸送了命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mistake. The guy screwed up, got my dad killed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.09,0:40:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这和… - 那个人就是你的老爸 迪恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What does this have to do? - It was your father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.30,0:40:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.17,0:40:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你觉得约翰为什么再也没回来 再也没和我们说过话？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you think John never came back? Never told you about us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.43,0:40:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他不敢再面对我的母亲 这就是原因{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because he couldn't look my mom in the eye after that. That's why.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.76,0:40:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 乔… - 给我离开这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jo - Just get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.60,0:40:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 快走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, just leave.{\r}
